---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Yutila">
	<div class="page-container">
		<PageHeader
			backHref="/"
			backLabel="Back Home"
			title="About"
			subtitle="Software, games and hardware"
			subtitleClass="about-subtitle"
		/>

		<section class="content-section">
			<div class="glass-card mission-card">
				<div class="card-glow"></div>
				<h2>Project Mandate</h2>
				<p>Yutila is an independent, community-driven collective dedicated to crafting robust and high&#8209;performance software, interactive media, and open hardware. We are built on a foundation of collaboration, technical transparency, and a deep respect for developer freedom and digital rights, rejecting rigid corporate dogmas to focus on what truly matters: elegant, secure, and user-centric engineering.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="glass-card status-card">
				<div class="card-glow"></div>
				<h2>Operational Status</h2>
				<div class="status-badge">
					<span class="pulse-dot"></span>
					Independent & Pre-revenue
				</div>
				<p>We are entirely self-funded, independent, and community-supported. Rather than chasing corporate profits or commercial venture capital, Yutila is sustained by shared passion, open-source validation, and collaborative effort. We rely on the diverse minds, perspectives, and skills of developers who believe in building a freer, more transparent web.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="content-section">
			<div class="glass-card full-width-card">
				<div class="card-glow"></div>
				<h2>Our Philosophy & Approach</h2>
				<p>We believe that great software is built through open dialogue, collective wisdom, and a commitment to quality. Our projects grow from transparent design discussions, where ideas are polished through collaborative peer feedback and tested against real-world utility.</p>

				<div class="incubation-grid">
					<div class="incubation-column">
						<h3>
							<svg class="heading-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
							For Our Community
						</h3>
						<p>We welcome dreamers, tinkers, and builders. Whether you're writing code, designing interfaces, or drafting documentation, Yutila is a collaborative space where every voice is heard and every contribution is valued.</p>
						<ul class="feature-list">
							<li>
								<div class="icon-wrapper">
									<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="7" x="3" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="9" height="7" x="3" y="14" rx="1"/><rect width="5" height="7" x="16" y="14" rx="1"/></svg>
								</div>
								<span><strong class="highlight-text">Collaborative Design:</strong> We begin our projects with open design documents, inviting the community to brainstorm, share insights, and shape the architecture together from day one.</span>
							</li>
							<li>
								<div class="icon-wrapper">
									<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg>
								</div>
								<span><strong class="highlight-text">Thoughtful Feedback:</strong> We hold thorough and constructive peer reviews, not to gatekeep, but to learn from each other and build systems that stand the test of time.</span>
							</li>
							<li>
								<div class="icon-wrapper">
									<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 9.9-1"/></svg>
								</div>
								<span><strong class="highlight-text">Absolute Transparency:</strong> All architectural decisions, source code, and design processes are completely open to the public, ensuring true digital sovereignty.</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<div class="incubation-column">
						<h3>
							<svg class="heading-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="7" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"/></svg>
							For Trust & Sovereignty
						</h3>
						<p>We build with an unwavering commitment to user privacy, individual autonomy, and absolute security. Your data belongs to you, and your systems should be under your control, always.</p>
						<ul class="feature-list">
							<li>
								<div class="icon-wrapper">
									<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
								</div>
								<span><strong class="highlight-text">Security by Default:</strong> We design our systems to protect you out of the box, employing defensive engineering, minimal data collection, and open security audits.</span>
							</li>
							<li>
								<div class="icon-wrapper">
									<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
								</div>
								<span><strong class="highlight-text">Privacy is a Human Right:</strong> We bake data minimization and tracking prevention into every line of code. We believe you shouldn't have to trade your privacy for utility.</span>
							</li>
							<li>
								<div class="icon-wrapper">
									<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"/><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="6" y2="6"/><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="18" y2="18"/></svg>
								</div>
								<span><strong class="highlight-text">Unyielding Independence:</strong> Our software is built to last, completely free of corporate backdoors, telemetry, or vendor lock-in. You own your software and hardware.</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p class="conclusion-text">This community-first philosophy ensures that we build reliable, secure, and respectful technology that empowers people, protects fundamental freedoms, and stands strong against corporate overreach.</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-container {
		gap: 4rem;
	}

	.about-subtitle {
		font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
		color: var(--text-color);
		opacity: 0.9;
		max-width: 800px;
		text-align: justify;
	}

	.content-section {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.glass-card {
		padding: 2.5rem;
	}

	.glass-card:hover {
		box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
	}

	.glass-card h2 {
		font-size: 1.8rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
		color: var(--text-color);
	}

	.glass-card p {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
		text-align: justify;
	}

	.glass-card p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.full-width-card {
		grid-column: 1 / -1;
	}

	.highlight-text {
		color: var(--text-color);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.incubation-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr));
		gap: 3rem;
		margin: 2.5rem 0;
	}

	.incubation-column h3 {
		font-size: 1.3rem;
		color: var(--yutila-blue);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.6rem;
	}

	.heading-icon {
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.feature-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 1.5rem 0 0 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}

	.feature-list li {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.icon-wrapper {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 20px;
		height: 20px;
		flex-shrink: 0;
		color: var(--yutila-blue);
		margin-top: 3px;
	}

	.feature-list a {
		color: var(--yutila-blue);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: text-decoration 0.2s;
	}

	.feature-list a:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.glass-card p.conclusion-text {
		color: var(--text-color);
		text-align: center;
		margin: 3rem 0 0 0;
		padding-top: 2rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.status-badge {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		background: rgba(94, 189, 62, 0.1);
		border: 1px solid rgba(94, 189, 62, 0.2);
		color: var(--yutila-green);
		padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.pulse-dot {
		width: 8px;
		height: 8px;
		background-color: var(--yutila-green);
		border-radius: 50%;
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(94, 189, 62, 0.7);
		animation: pulse 2s infinite;
	}

	@keyframes pulse {
		0% {
			transform: scale(0.95);
			box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(94, 189, 62, 0.7);
		}
		70% {
			transform: scale(1);
			box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(94, 189, 62, 0);
		}
		100% {
			transform: scale(0.95);
			box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(94, 189, 62, 0);
		}
	}


	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.content-section {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		.glass-card {
			padding: 1.5rem;
		}
		.incubation-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}
	}
</style>
